 - Lets a Sysop or Co-Sysop enter in the name of a new user and it will show
   that new user's application.
 - Also a new feature was added to view the new users that are on the bbs, so
   you dont have to go to the account editor to find them.
 - If the sysop uses the High Commands Password then it will be used for this
   util too, so the co-sysop will have to know the password as well. If the
   password is not used by the sysop then my util wont even ask for a password!
 - Also for security I have it keep track of every entry entered by a user and
   it is recorded in the sysop activity log for the node the user is on.
 - Enter Account Number or Handle to see their application.


 - Just hit return to quit the door once in it.
 - 'N' or 'n' To view list of new users on bbs.
   (Shows User Slow Number, Handle, Location, & Computer Type)
 - Remember it is a DOOR! not a util.. so you must also edit your Doors.opt
   file, which is also in the OPTIONAL Dir. You must add this door just like
   you would any other door.. but make sure only sysops, or whoever you want
   to use it, has access.

 LEGEND OF EXAMPLE ABOVE:

        # = Users Number
   Handle = Users Handle
 Location = Users Location
   1st On = First call made by user
   LastOn = Last call made by user
 Computer = Computer Type of user
       On = How many times user as called



